      },
      "urpx:description": "Vintaged Power Charge Indifference Adjustment (per kWh) applied to Transitional Bundled Service (TBS), Community Choice Aggregation (CCA), and Direct Access (DA) customers on Schedule E-1. Replaces the Bundled PCIA for these customers; the applicable rate is determined by the customer's bundled-service departure vintage year.",
      "urpx:effectiveDateTime": "2026-03-01T00:00:00",
      "urpx:forRatePlanModifier": {
